---
title: "cancel (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyProject
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenCancelNotLocked
    q_guard3 --> q_markCanceled: s_saleStatus.isCanceled = true
    q_markCanceled --> q_emit: emit SaleCanceled()
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_guard3
        INV-001: Cancel is blocked once initializePublishSaleResults() locks cancel
        INV-002: This prevents project from canceling after Legion starts publishing
        INV-003: After cancel, investors can withdraw via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()
    end note
